<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE - Producer prices, import prices.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE - Producer prices, import prices.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German Statistics Office said on Friday that the following German economic indicators are expected to be released next week:</p>
<p>    INDICATOR	PERIOD    PREVIOUS		EXPECTED</p>
<p>					   DATA		    DATE</p>
<p> Insolvencies	Oct    Sep +8.2 y/y	     Jan 21 or 22</p>
<p> Producer prices   Dec    Nov unch m/m, -0.3     Jan 21 or 22</p>
<p> Import prices     Dec    Nov unch m/m, +1.4 y/y Jan 24 or 27</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
